# Nothing brand/account-specific ever belongs in this repo. All of that data
# lives client-side only, in the browser's IndexedDB, via the in-app Excel
# upload. If a file matching these patterns ever shows up staged, stop and
# check it before committing -- see data/geo/ and data/nearby/ for the
# legitimate exceptions (public Michigan county boundaries and public
# OpenStreetMap business listings, no account data).
*.xlsx
*.xls
*-addresses.csv
*-addresses.coords.json
*.coords.json
data/uploads/
node_modules/
.wrangler/
